### Floor Plan Mobile App Test

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Login to get token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marco@italiandelight.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "businessSlug": "italian-delight"
}

### 1. Test existing endpoint - Get all floor plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/floor-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Test existing endpoint - Get floor plan with tables (if floor plan ID 1 exists)
GET {{baseUrl}}/floor-plans/1/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Test existing endpoint - Get available tables for floor plan
GET {{baseUrl}}/floor-plans/1/available-tables
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Test debug endpoint to see all data
GET {{baseUrl}}/test/floor-plans

### 5. Test with different user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "yuki@sushimaster.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "businessSlug": "sushi-master"
}

### 6. Test floor plans with different business
GET {{baseUrl}}/floor-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}} 